# rpg_space_planet_map.phases.pdl - asteroids and another ship ON THE PLANET MAP, the same space as the ship and Cata Prime (owner 2026-10-26: "i expected to see them on same map as planet/ship cata prime"). BOOK 16.game/RPG-SPACE-COLLISION-AND-DESTRUCTION-DESIGN.md 7i.
# Runner: ops/+x/playthrough_op.+x run play/phases/rpg_space_planet_map.phases.pdl (a scratch house under /tmp; nothing live is touched).
# Geometry the expected values come from: the hull covers desk cells 2..13 of the 16 x 16 desk; a desk cell = world cell minus the flight shift (state/direct.txt); the beam reaches obj_reach=2 cells from the hull rectangle; the hull may not sit on an object while the ship flies at or below obj_top=6.
GAME | rpg-space | rpg_space
EVENTS | yes
NEEDS | &.widgits/world-ops/ops/+x/wo.+x
# the rpg-space skin text-includes the shared petslike core and its helpers (the scratch house has only what is listed)
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_core.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_toolbar.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_sky.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_footer.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_nudge.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/kh_state_notify.h
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/csv_frames.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_skin_lib.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_autotile.c
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_gen.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_seed.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_zoom.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_orbit.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/ops/+x/dust_check.+x
# the planet pages are painted from RPG Maker sheets (the assets live above the house)
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-space/rpg-space-pchq/pieces/ship_01/model.txt
CFLAGS | -I$T/@.apps/rpg-space/ops
INIT | state/pet_ember.txt | room=bridge\nx=9\ny=5\ndir=1\nsteps=5\ntx=-1\nty=-1\n
INIT | state/life_ember.txt | hp=20\nhunger=3\ndead=0\ndeaths=0\ninv=bread:5,iron:11,scrap:32\n

INIT | state/look_ledger.txt | PLANET\p cata\n
# the gate's own seed rows (the geometry every pin below is worked out from): the real space.pdl puts the objects far out on the 48 x 48 land, this one keeps them against the hull
INIT | space.pdl | ROCK  \p rock_1 \p 2 \p 2 \p ore     \p 6 \p Rusty Rock\nROCK  \p rock_2 \p 1 \p 3 \p rock    \p 8 \p Grey Chunk\nROCK  \p rock_3 \p 3 \p 1 \p crystal \p 3 \p Glint\nCRAFT \p skiff_1 \p 2 \p 4 \p Wren (skiff) \p pip:12:0:0,nova:12:1:0 \p iron:2,bread:3\nWROCK  \p wr_1 \p cata \p 15 \p 5  \p ore     \p 5\nWROCK  \p wr_2 \p cata \p 3  \p 14 \p rock    \p 7\nWROCK  \p wr_3 \p cata \p 0  \p 9  \p crystal \p 3\nWCRAFT \p skiff_1 \p cata \p 14 \p 1 \p Wren\n

PHASE | p1_seed | space.pdl WROCK and WCRAFT rows put three asteroids and the skiff on the planet map, once | planet map, seed, data
DO | space | status
FILEIS | state/pworld_planet.txt | cata\n | the-objects-belong-to-cata-prime
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p15\p5\pore\p5 | ore-asteroid-at-world-15-5
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p7 | rock-asteroid-at-world-3-14
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p0\p9\pcrystal\p3 | crystal-asteroid-at-world-0-9
HAS | state/craft.txt | iron:2,bread:3\p14\p1 | the-skiff-has-a-world-cell-14-1
COUNT | state/space_seeded.txt | w_ | 4 | four-world-rows-seeded-once
DO | space | status
COUNT | state/space_seeded.txt | w_ | 4 | a-second-call-seeds-nothing-more

PHASE | p2_beam | in direct flight at the start the beam mines the NEAREST asteroid (the rock, 1 cell from the hull edge), then the next one (the ore, 2 cells) | mine, beam, direct, planet map
PUT | state/flag_helm.txt | 1\n
PUT | state/helm_mode.txt | direct\n
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n
DO | mine | here
SAY | rock broke at region 3,14 | the-nearest-asteroid-is-the-rock-and-one-beam-hit-breaks-it
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p6 | the-rock-node-has-one-load-less
LACKS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p7 | the-old-rock-count-is-gone
HAS | state/drops.txt | region\p3\p14 | remnants-lie-on-the-planet-map-cell
DO | mine | here
SAY | rock broke at region 3,14 | the-rock-still-has-loads-so-it-is-still-the-nearest
HAS | state/nodes.txt | region\p3\p14\prock\p5 | the-rock-node-has-two-loads-less
PUT | state/direct.txt | 10 0\n
DO | mine | here
SAY | /5 | flown-east-the-ore-is-the-asteroid-beside-the-hull-and-takes-5-hits
HAS | state/damage.txt | region\p15\p5 | ore-damage-is-recorded-on-the-planet-map-cell
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n

PHASE | p3_hull | the hull may not be flown onto the ore asteroid or onto the skiff while it flies low, and may when it flies above them | collision, planet map, altitude
PUT | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
SAY | an asteroid is in the way at 15,5 | low-hull-refused-over-the-asteroid
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n | the-ship-did-not-move
PUT | state/craft.txt | skiff_1\p2\p4\pWren (skiff)\ppip:12:0:0,nova:12:1:0\piron:2,bread:3\p8\p-6\n
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 -5\n
DO | helm | move | 0 | -1
SAY | Wren (skiff) is there | low-hull-refused-over-the-skiff-by-its-6-wide-footprint
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 0 -5\n | the-ship-did-not-move
PUT | state/direct_z.txt | 8\n
PUT | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 2 0\n | high-hull-flies-over-the-asteroid

PHASE | p4_voxels | asteroids and the skiff are VOXEL PIECES (pieces/veh_N: state.txt + model.txt) that the engine draws as boxes, not flat tiles (owner 2026-10-26) | voxel, pieces, planet map
PUT | state/direct_z.txt | 8\n
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n | flown-one-cell-east
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | entity_type=vehicle | an-asteroid-is-a-vehicle-piece
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | desk=bridge | drawn-on-the-bridge-desk-where-the-land-is
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | pos_x=13.00 | ore-at-world-15-5-minus-flight-shift-1-centred-on-its-3-wide-box
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | pos_y=3.50 | ore-at-world-y-5-centred-on-its-4-deep-box
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | pos_z=-8 | the-land-and-its-rocks-sink-by-the-ship-altitude
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | size_h=3.00 | box-height-is-the-nugget-height
COUNT | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/model.txt | \n | 12 | ore-nugget-is-11-voxels-plus-the-dim-line
COUNT | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_2/model.txt | \n | 12 | rock-nugget-is-11-voxels-plus-the-dim-line
COUNT | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_3/model.txt | \n | 8 | crystal-nugget-is-7-voxels-plus-the-dim-line
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/model.txt | dim 24 16 24 | the-skiff-is-a-6x6-layout-of-4-voxel-tile-cubes-floor-plus-3-wall-levels-high
COUNT | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/model.txt | \n | 2647 | the-skiff-has-2646-tile-cube-voxels-plus-the-dim-line-only-cubes-with-a-free-face
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | pos_x=4.50 | skiff-at-world-8-minus-shift-1-centred-on-its-6-wide-box
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | pos_y=-8.50 | skiff-at-world-y-minus-6-centred-on-its-6-deep-box
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | size_x=6.00 | skiff-box-is-6-cells-wide
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | size_h=4.00 | and-4-cells-high-a-floor-cube-plus-3-wall-cubes
NOFILE | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_5/state.txt | only-four-objects-so-no-fifth-piece
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 2 0\n | flown-another-cell-east
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | pos_x=3.50 | the-skiff-slid-one-cell-with-the-flight
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | pos_x=12.00 | the-ore-slid-one-cell-with-the-flight
COUNT | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/model.txt | \n | 12 | the-nugget-keeps-its-shape-when-the-ship-moves
COUNT | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_3/model.txt | \n | 8 | the-crystal-keeps-its-shape-too
DO | helm | off
NOFILE | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_1/state.txt | releasing-the-helm-removes-the-asteroid-pieces
NOFILE | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | releasing-the-helm-removes-the-skiff-piece

PHASE | p5_pilot | `space pilot <id>` hands the helm's arrows to the other ship: it flies over the planet map (craft.txt wx, wy), stays out of the player's hull while that flies low, and the player's ship stays put (owner 2026-10-27: its own working helm) | pilot, collision, planet map
DO | space | pilot | skiff_1
SAY | take the helm first | pilot-needs-the-helm-in-direct-flight
PUT | state/flag_helm.txt | 1\n
PUT | state/helm_mode.txt | direct\n
PUT | state/direct_z.txt | 1\n
PUT | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n
DO | space | pilot | skiff_1
SAY | you fly Wren (skiff) | the-skiff-is-piloted
FILEIS | state/pilot.txt | skiff_1\n | the-pilot-is-remembered
DO | helm | move | 0 | 1
FILEIS | state/craft.txt | skiff_1\p2\p4\pWren (skiff)\ppip:12:0:0,nova:12:1:0\piron:2,bread:3\p8\p-5\n| the-arrow-moved-the-skiff-south-one-cell
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 0 0\n | and-the-players-ship-did-not-move
HAS | rpg-space-pchq/pieces/veh_4/state.txt | pos_y=-7.50 | the-skiff-piece-followed-at-once
DO | helm | move | 0 | 1
DO | helm | move | 0 | 1
DO | helm | move | 0 | 1
FILEIS | state/craft.txt | skiff_1\p2\p4\pWren (skiff)\ppip:12:0:0,nova:12:1:0\piron:2,bread:3\p8\p-2\n| four-cells-south-the-skiffs-box-ends-one-cell-from-the-hull
DO | helm | move | 0 | 1
SAY | your ship's hull is in the way | the-skiff-cannot-fly-through-the-low-hull
FILEIS | state/craft.txt | skiff_1\p2\p4\pWren (skiff)\ppip:12:0:0,nova:12:1:0\piron:2,bread:3\p8\p-2\n| and-it-stayed
DO | space | pilot | off
PUT | state/direct_z.txt | 8\n
DO | helm | move | 1 | 0
FILEIS | state/direct.txt | 1 0\n | after-pilot-off-the-arrows-fly-the-players-ship-again
DO | helm | off
NOFILE | state/pilot.txt | releasing-the-helm-clears-the-pilot
